# Auth Service

### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "user12",
    "password": "12345678"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "test1",
    "password": "test1234"
}


# User Service

### Create Profile
POST http://localhost:8080/users/profile
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{
    "name": "test",
    "address": "test",
    "phone": "test"
}

### Get Profile
GET http://localhost:8080/users/profile
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

### Update Profile
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/profile
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{
    "name": "test1",
    "address": "test1",
    "phone": "test1"
}

## Product Service

### Create Product
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Macbook Pro 16",
    "description": "Macbook Pro 16",
    "price": 1299000,
    "quantity": 1
}

### Get Product By Id
GET http://localhost:8080/products/11
Content-Type: application/json

### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json


## Order Service

### Create Order
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{
    "items": [
        {
            "productId": 1,
            "productName": "Product 1",
            "productPrice": 100.00,
            "quantity": 3
        },
        {
            "productId": 2,
            "productName": "Product 2",
            "productPrice": 200.00,
            "quantity": 1
        }
    ],
    "paymentMethod": "PROMPT_PAY",
    "paymentCurrency": "THB"
}

### Get Order By OrderId
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/customer/f947176b-677b-409d-917e-2bacdf2575f8
X-User-Id: 1

### Pay Order
POST http://localhost:8086/payments/order/f947176b-677b-409d-917e-2bacdf2575f8/pay

### Cancel Order
POST http://localhost:8086/payments/order/d019a4a7-81cf-45c6-a807-c634ad600569/cancel

### Refund Order
POST http://localhost:8086/payments/order/f947176b-677b-409d-917e-2bacdf2575f8/refund